<Docs title="Contributing"><h1>Contributing</h1><p>Issues, experiments, tests, documentation, and compiler work are welcome in the GitHub repository.</p><pre><code>./build_all.sh
edl/scripts/build.sh
edl/scripts/test.sh</code></pre><p>Keep EDL changes inside <code>edl/</code> unless a task specifically targets the bootstrap substrate. Read <code>edl/README.md</code> and the relevant architecture decisions before changing the dialect.</p></Docs>
